"><img src=\"/art/crops/tomatoes/3-first-growth.svg\" alt=\"Tomatoes: first growth\" data-stage=\"3-first-growth\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><span class=\"no\">iii.</span><span class=\"lbl\">first growth</span></li>\n            <li><div class=\"slot\"><img src=\"/art/crops/tomatoes/4-second-growth.svg\" alt=\"Tomatoes: second growth\" data-stage=\"4-second-growth\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><span class=\"no\">iv.</span><span class=\"lbl\">second growth</span></li>\n            <li><div class=\"slot\"><img src=\"/art/crops/tomatoes/5-third-growth.svg\" alt=\"Tomatoes: third growth\" data-stage=\"5-third-growth\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><span class=\"no\">v.</span><span class=\"lbl\">third growth</span></li>\n            <li><div class=\"slot\"><img src=\"/art/crops/tomatoes/6-harvest.svg\" alt=\"Tomatoes: ready\" data-stage=\"6-harvest\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><span class=\"no\">vi.</span><span class=\"lbl\">ready</span></li>\n            <li><div class=\"slot\"><img src=\"/art/crops/tomatoes/7-harvest-front.svg\" alt=\"Tomatoes: harvested\" data-stage=\"7-harvest-front\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><span class=\"no\">vii.</span><span class=\"lbl\">harvested</span></li>\n            <li><div class=\"slot\"><img src=\"/art/crops/tomatoes/8-dead.svg\" alt=\"Tomatoes: wilted\" data-stage=\"8-dead\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><span class=\"no\">viii.</span><span class=\"lbl\">wilted</span></li>\n          </ol>\n          <p class=\"margin-note\">One of 60 and more. The rest are still growing somewhere.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"folio\"><a class=\"turn-link\" href=\"#pace\" data-turn=\"pace\">turn to your pace <svg width=\"34\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 10c8-3 18-4 29-1M25 3c2.5 2 4.5 4 6 6-2.5 1.3-5 3-7 5\"/></svg></a><span>39</span></div>"
